## Why This Is Asked
Tests a candidate’s ability to design end-to-end evaluation for private, privacy-conscious enterprise assistants, focusing on faithfulness, hallucination, and safety under real-world data/versioning constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Grounding to versioned sources and source IDs
- Hallucination detection in live responses
- Privacy safety: PII/secret leakage checks in output and citations
- Performance metrics under load and latency budgets

## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal evaluation script outline (pseudo)
function evaluate(model, corpus) {
  const prompts = loadPrompts();
  return prompts.map(p => {
    const out = model.respond(p);
    const grounded = ground(out, corpus, p);
    return { prompt: p, output: out, grounded };
  });
}
```

